OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,6,Fvariable cloud and some hazy sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Winds will be a mainly light
OL,8,Fsoutherly and it will become very warm.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA dry bright evening then a
OL,11,Fmainly dry night with some clear
OL,12,Fspells, though a few showers may
OL,13,Fspread to western Argyll by morning.
OL,14,
OL,15,CWednesday:FA bright and mainly dry day
OL,16,Fwith some sunny intervals at times.
OL,17,FThere could be the odd brief heavy
OL,18,Fshower, mostly over Argyll. Very warm
OL,19,For hot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
