OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday mainly hot and sunny, chance
OL,7,Fof showers in far west. Friday and
OL,8,FSaturday cloudier and cooler with a
OL,9,Ffew showers.
